{
  "tema": 6002,
  "slug": "imperfecto-describir-pasado",
  "titulo": "The imperfect to describe the past",
  "subtitulo": "Eran las seis, hacía frío y la playa estaba vacía.",
  "foto": "t06.jpg",
  "regla": "To describe how things were in the past (time, age, weather, places, people, feelings, what was going on), use the imperfect. It sets the scene; it doesn't tell what happened next.",
  "comparada_kwiziq": null,
  "secciones": [
    {
      "id": "regla",
      "titulo": "The rule",
      "bloques": [
        {
          "tipo": "texto",
          "texto": "The imperfect **paints the background** of a past scene. Use it for:"
        },
        {
          "tipo": "tabla",
          "encabezados": [
            "What you describe",
            "Example"
          ],
          "filas": [
            [
              "clock time",
              "**Eran** las seis. **Era** la una."
            ],
            [
              "age",
              "**Tenía** veinte años."
            ],
            [
              "weather",
              "**Hacía** frío. **Llovía**."
            ],
            [
              "places and things",
              "La playa **estaba** vacía. **Había** mucha gente."
            ],
            [
              "people (looks, character)",
              "**Era** alto y muy serio."
            ],
            [
              "feelings and states",
              "**Estaba** cansado. **Tenía** hambre."
            ],
            [
              "what was going on",
              "La gente **bailaba**."
            ]
          ]
        },
        {
          "tipo": "texto",
          "texto": "Clock time uses **ser**: **era** la una, but **eran** las dos, las seis, las once."
        },
        {
          "tipo": "texto",
          "texto": "The preterite tells the **events** (_llegué, empezó, se fue_). The imperfect describes the **setting** around them."
        },
        {
          "tipo": "texto",
          "texto": "Tip: if you could film it as a still frame, use the imperfect."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "ejemplos",
      "titulo": "Examples",
      "bloques": [
        {
          "tipo": "ejemplos",
          "lista": [
            {
              "es": "==Eran== las seis y ==hacía== frío.",
              "en": "It was six o'clock and it was cold."
            },
            {
              "es": "==Era== la una de la mañana cuando llegamos.",
              "en": "It was one in the morning when we arrived."
            },
            {
              "es": "Cuando me mudé a Tijuana, ==tenía== veinte años.",
              "en": "When I moved to Tijuana, I was twenty."
            },
            {
              "es": "==Llovía== y la playa ==estaba== vacía.",
              "en": "It was raining and the beach was empty."
            },
            {
              "es": "==Había== mucha gente en el mercado.",
              "en": "There were a lot of people at the market."
            },
            {
              "es": "Mi primer maestro de jiu-jitsu ==era== alto y muy serio.",
              "en": "My first jiu-jitsu teacher was tall and very serious."
            },
            {
              "es": "==Estábamos== cansados y ==teníamos== hambre.",
              "en": "We were tired and hungry."
            },
            {
              "es": "El mar ==estaba== tranquilo y las olas ==eran== pequeñas.",
              "en": "The sea was calm and the waves were small."
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
